msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_library.rst:64
msgid ""
"Predefined answers (options) for prompt sometimes need to be described or"
" are too complex to select via their value. ``promptByKey()`` allows the "
"user to select an option by its key instead of its value:"
